# Model weights and other binaries — never let any git client apply
# line-ending conversion (CRLF<->LF) to these, regardless of a local
# core.autocrlf setting. A silent conversion on a binary file corrupts it
# without any error at commit/push time — the failure only shows up later
# as a load error (e.g. onnxruntime's "Protobuf parsing failed").
*.onnx binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
